From: amd-gfx <amd-gfx-bounces-PD4FTy7X32lNgt0PjOBp9y5qC8QIuHrW@public.gmane.org> on behalf of Russell,=
 Kent <Kent.Russell-5C7GfCeVMHo@public.gmane.org>
